flowchart TD
    Main["main.py: main()"]
    Args["argparse reads operation, repo, and --db"]
    Main --> Args

    Args -->|import| Import["connector.py: import_issues()"]
    Args -->|read| Read["connector.py: read_issues()"]

    Import --> Fetch["github_client.py: fetch_issues()"]
    Fetch -->|One GET request| API["GitHub REST API"]
    API -->|Response| Extract["_extract_issues()"]
    Extract --> Filter["Exclude pull requests"]
    Filter --> Validate["Validate number, title, and URL"]
    Validate --> URL["_is_browser_url()"]
    URL --> Records["Sorted issue records"]
    Records -->|Return to import_issues| Save["database.py: upsert_issues()"]

    Save --> Transaction["BEGIN → create table → UPSERT"]
    Transaction -->|Commit on success; rollback on failure| DB[("issues.db")]

    Read --> Query["database.py: read_saved_issues()"]
    DB -->|SELECT by repository; order by issue number| Query

    Save -->|Save completes| Result["connector.py: _result()"]
    Query -->|Saved issue records| Result

    Fetch -.->|Expected API failure| Error["ConnectorError"]
    Save -.->|Expected database failure| Error
    Query -.->|Expected database failure| Error
    Error -->|Caught by import_issues or read_issues| Result

    Result --> Output["main(): serialize result with json.dumps()"]
    Output --> Success["Success: stdout, exit 0"]
    Output --> Failure["Operation failure: stderr, exit 1"]